{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catwifhat</strong> is a free-to-play idle clicker where <strong>clicking drops items and skins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By clicking on adorable cats in hats, every click has a chance to drop loot \u2014 including ultra-rare items with odds as low as <strong>1 in 1,000,000</strong> per click. You can play actively or leave the game running AFK and see what drops over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 3 hours, you also receive a <strong>unique cat</strong>, adding to your growing collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Hour Cat Drop Pool:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMON</strong> \u2014 60% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOMMON</strong> \u2014 16%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RARE</strong> \u2014 3.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC</strong> \u2014 0.499%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGENDARY</strong> \u2014 0.00099% (1 / 101,010)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MYTHIC</strong> \u2014 0.00001% (1 / 10,000,000)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL</strong> \u2014 Available during events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LITTER BOX</strong> \u2014 20% </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clicking Drop System</strong> \u2014 every click has a chance to drop items and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle &amp; AFK friendly \u2014 leave the game running in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cats, items, talismans, cosmetics, materials, tools, and future weapon drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Litter Boxes \u2014 open them with Lockpicks to receive cats and valuable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autoclickers \u2014 click for you even while AFK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards System \u2014 claim rewards up to LVL 20 (more coming)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved visuals and redesigned UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music, click sounds &amp; adjustable audio settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, experiment, and see what drops \u2014 or just leave it running and check back later.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1 Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/c2bfa3011d84ea027a287435dd2816f0065d4390.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5 Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/d7e10450365828d3717078b1bacc6a705654edaf.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10 Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/6641bd94659e09aa89bb7eeec2744f7f41a296ca.jpg"},{"name":"Basic Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/15b9b882478903667131777f1d4c3400ec00a55d.jpg"},{"name":"Robber Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/eb6df491e26f2f9d0b1403eb029796c74e5013a2.jpg"},{"name":"Prince Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/5f285b9bc0b3793af9d27b1902e864d041837b66.jpg"},{"name":"Midnight Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/a32134eeb34941304e57f419dd4aeaa3d066f47e.jpg"},{"name":"Batman Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/99a93edf770c63afa1ef3ea3322016fe60b18dd7.jpg"},{"name":"Illuminati Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3169620/c59e56b05292effd25da35aaa0e