>COMMON</strong> \u2014 60% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOMMON</strong> \u2014 16%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RARE</strong> \u2014 3.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC</strong> \u2014 0.499%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGENDARY</strong> \u2014 0.00099% (1 / 101,010)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MYTHIC</strong> \u2014 0.00001% (1 / 10,000,000)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL</strong> \u2014 Available during events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LITTER BOX</strong> \u2014 20% </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clicking Drop System</strong> \u2014 every click has a chance to drop items and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle &amp; AFK friendly \u2014 leave the game running in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cats, items, talismans, cosmetics, materials, tools, and future weapon drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Litter Boxes \u2014 open them with Lockpicks to receive cats and valuable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autoclickers \u2014 click for you even while AFK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards System \u2014 claim rewards up to LVL 20 (more coming)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved visuals and redesigned UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music, click sounds &amp; adjustable audio settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, experiment, and see what drops \u2014 or just leave it running and check back later.</p>","developers":["Clawz"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste